{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 工具调用与MCP MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"MCP 的跨平台兼容性实现（stdio/HTTP/SSE）\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"工具调用与MCP\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> medium\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/工具调用\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/04-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/04-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工具调用与MCP MOC</a></p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">MCP 支持哪些传输方式？各有什么优缺点？如何实现跨平台兼容性？</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">MCP 的跨平台能力来自于传输层的设计——协议层（JSON-RPC 2.0）与传输层解耦，使得同一份协议可以通过不同的传输方式实现。</p>\n<h3 data-heading=\"三种传输方式对比\" dir=\"auto\">三种传输方式对比</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>stdio</th>\n<th>SSE (Server-Sent Events)</th>\n<th>Streamable HTTP</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>通信方式</strong></td>\n<td>本地进程管道</td>\n<td>HTTP 长连接 + SSE</td>\n<td>标准 HTTP + 动态流式升级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>适用场景</strong></td>\n<td>本地开发、隐私数据</td>\n<td>实时远程通知</td>\n<td>云原生、分布式系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>网络依赖</strong></td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>必需</td>\n<td>必需</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>多客户端</strong></td>\n<td>否（单客户端）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>延迟</strong></td>\n<td>1-5ms</td>\n<td>50ms+</td>\n<td>50ms+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>安全等级</strong></td>\n<td>★★★★★</td>\n<td>★★★★☆</td>\n<td>★★★★☆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>跨平台</strong></td>\n<td>所有 OS 支持 stdio</td>\n<td>依赖 HTTP 库</td>\n<td>依赖 HTTP 库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>协议演进</strong></td>\n<td>长期支持</td>\n<td>即将废弃</td>\n<td>官方推荐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 data-heading=\"stdio（标准输入输出）\" dir=\"auto\">stdio（标准输入输出）</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">MCP 默认的通信方式，Client 通过子进程启动 Server，通过 stdin/stdout 通信。</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># Server 端（stdio 模式）</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> mcp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>server<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>fastmcp <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> FastMCP\n\nmcp <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> FastMCP<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"local-server\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@mcp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">read_file</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>path<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"读取本地文件\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">with</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">open</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>path<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'r'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> f<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> f<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>read<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> __name__ <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"__main__\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    mcp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>run<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>transport<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"stdio\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 从 stdin 读取，stdout 输出</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># Client 端（stdio 模式）</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> mcp <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> StdioServerParameters\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> mcp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>client<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>stdio <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> stdio_client\n\nserver_params <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> StdioServerParameters<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    command<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"python\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    args<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"server.py\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    env<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">None</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">connect</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># stdio_client 启动 Server 子进程</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">with</span> stdio_client<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>server_params<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>read<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> write<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># read 读取 Server 的 stdout</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># write 写入 Server 的 stdin</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>消息格式</strong>：每条消息是一行 JSON-RPC 2.0 + 换行符</p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1,\"method\":\"tools/list\"}\\n\n{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1,\"result\":{\"tools\":[...]}}\\n\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>优点</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">极低延迟（进程间通信，无网络开销）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">极高安全性（不暴露网络端口）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">简单实现（无需网络配置）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">所有操作系统原生支持</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>缺点</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">仅限本地（Client 和 Server 必须在同一台机器）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">单客户端（一个 Server 进程只能服务一个 Client）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">子进程崩溃可能影响主进程</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-heading=\"Streamable HTTP（推荐方案）\" dir=\"auto\">Streamable HTTP（推荐方案）</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">SSE 的升级版，完全基于标准 HTTP 协议，支持动态升级为 SSE 流。</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># Server 端（HTTP 模式）</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> mcp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>server<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>fastmcp <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> FastMCP\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> mcp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>server<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>sse <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> SseServerTransport\n\nmcp <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> FastMCP<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"http-server\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@app<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>post</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"/message\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">handle_message</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>request<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Request<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"处理客户端消息\"\"\"</span>\n    body <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> request<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>body<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 解析 JSON-RPC 请求并处理</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>\n\n<span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@app<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"/sse\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">handle_sse</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>request<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Request<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"SSE 连接端点\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>核心优势</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>无状态支持</strong>：Server 可以完全无状态运行，适配云函数（AWS Lambda）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>基础设施兼容</strong>：与 CDN、API 网关、负载均衡无缝集成</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>HTTP/2/3 支持</strong>：支持多路复用和双向流</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>动态流式升级</strong>：普通 HTTP 请求可按需升级为 SSE 流</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-heading=\"跨平台兼容性最佳实践\" dir=\"auto\">跨平台兼容性最佳实践</h3>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">CrossPlatformMCPClient</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"跨平台 MCP 客户端，自动适配传输方式\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@staticmethod</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">connect_stdio</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>command<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> args<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"stdio 方式连接（本地）\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> mcp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>client<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>stdio <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> stdio_client\n        server_params <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> StdioServerParameters<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>command<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>command<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> args<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>args<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> stdio_client<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>server_params<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@staticmethod</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">connect_http</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>url<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> headers<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"HTTP 方式连接（远程）\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> mcp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>client<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>http <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> http_client\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> http_client<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>url<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> headers<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>headers<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@staticmethod</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">auto_detect</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>server_config<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"根据配置自动选择传输方式\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> server_config<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"transport\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"stdio\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> CrossPlatformMCPClient<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>connect_stdio<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n                server_config<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"command\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                server_config<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"args\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">elif</span> server_config<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"transport\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"http\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> CrossPlatformMCPClient<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>connect_http<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n                server_config<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"url\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                server_config<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"headers\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">else</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">raise</span> ValueError<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"不支持的传输方式: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>server_config<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h3 data-heading=\"传输方式选择建议\" dir=\"auto\">传输方式选择建议</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐方式</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>本地开发调试</td>\n<td>stdio</td>\n<td>零配置、低延迟、高安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本地隐私数据处理</td>\n<td>stdio</td>\n<td>数据不出本机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>团队共享服务</td>\n<td>Streamable HTTP</td>\n<td>多客户端、可扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>云函数部署</td>\n<td>Streamable HTTP</td>\n<td>无状态、按需计费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微服务架构</td>\n<td>Streamable HTTP</td>\n<td>服务发现、负载均衡</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 data-heading=\"跨平台注意事项\" dir=\"auto\">跨平台注意事项</h3>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>路径分隔符</strong>：Windows 用 <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">\\</code>，Linux/macOS 用 <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">/</code>——使用 <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">pathlib</code> 处理</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>进程启动方式</strong>：Windows 需要 <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">shell=True</code> 或 <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">.cmd</code> 后缀</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>环境变量</strong>：不同平台的环境变量设置方式不同</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>编码问题</strong>：统一使用 UTF-8</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: SSE 为什么被淘汰？</strong><br>\nA: SSE 有数据格式限制（只支持文本）、跨平台兼容性差、基于 HTTP/1.1 长连接性能有限。Streamable HTTP 是其升级替代方案。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: stdio 的双向通信有什么问题？</strong><br>\nA: stdio 本应是单向的（stdin 输入、stdout 输出），MCP 将其改造为双向通信，这在 Unix/Linux 哲学中有点\"反直觉\"，但实现了零配置的本地通信。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：stdio 只能用于简单场景。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：stdio 延迟最低、最安全，很多生产环境（如 Cursor）也在用。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：HTTP 方式一定比 stdio 好。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：HTTP 有网络开销，本地场景 stdio 更优。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：所有平台都可以随便选传输方式。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：Windows 上 stdio 可能需要额外处理路径和进程启动方式。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>","headings":[]}